---
import SiteLayout from "@layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Sunny Copy – Good job."
  description="Design and development work by John Basham."
  home={false}
>
  <div class="archive-page">
    <article
      class="category-case-study format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry post post-67 status-publish tag-brand tag-web type-post"
      id="post-67"
      itemprop="blogPost"
      itemscope
      itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
      role="article"
    >
      <header class="article-header entry-header">
        <div class="post-tag">
          <span>Brand</span>
        </div>
        <div class="post-tag">
          <span>Web</span>
        </div>
        <div class="post-cat">
          <span>Case Study</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="entry-title single-title" itemprop="headline">
          Sunny Copy
        </h1>
      </header>
      <section class="entry-content" itemprop="articleBody">
        <div class="featured-image">
          <label for="expand-toggle" id="expand-image">
            <img
              alt=""
              class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image"
              decoding="async"
              fetchpriority="high"
              height="1020"
              sizes="(max-width: 1650px) 100vw, 1650px"
              src="/uploads/2019/05/case-study-sunny-copy-cmps.jpg"
              srcset="
                  /uploads/2019/05/case-study-sunny-copy-cmps.jpg          1650w,
                  /uploads/2019/05/case-study-sunny-copy-cmps-300x185.jpg   300w,
                  /uploads/2019/05/case-study-sunny-copy-cmps-768x475.jpg   768w,
                  /uploads/2019/05/case-study-sunny-copy-cmps-1024x633.jpg 1024w
                "
              width="1650"
            />
          </label>
        </div>
        <p>
          <small>
            <strong>Website:</strong>
            <a
              href="https://sunnycopy.com/"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              target="_blank"
            >
              sunnycopy.com
            </a>
          </small>
          <br />
          <small>
            <strong>Services:</strong> branding, 
          </small>
          <small>design, d</small>
          <small>evelop, deploy, optimisation</small>
        </p>
        <hr class="wp-block-separator" />
        <p>
          Sunny Copy is the brainchild of Jenna Meade; a copywriting freelancer
          targeting other creatives.
        </p>
        <p>
          Words being the focus for her work and brand, we agreed on a simple
          design not only for the website but logo too, conveying her message in
          a minimal manner.
        </p>
        <p>
          Using a single page static website gave us the most flexibility and
          optimal performance. Small touches of javascript animations and a
          careful touch of colour help bring to life the words she so
          beautifully writes and all elements tie harmoniously together.
        </p>
        <figure class="is-resized wp-block-image">
          <img
            alt="Animated text: The text appears as if typed on the Sunny Copy homepage"
            class="wp-image-274"
            decoding="async"
            height="339"
            src="/uploads/2019/06/sunnycopy-homepage.gif"
            width="580"
          />
          <figcaption>Typed text draws the view into the words.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <hr class="wp-block-separator" />
        <div class="size-medium wp-block-image wp-image-56">
          <figure class="aligncenter is-resized">
            <img
              alt="Performance Score for the sunnycopy website by GT Metrix. Pagespeed Score 100%. YSlow Score = 90%"
              class="wp-image-272"
              decoding="async"
              height="107"
              sizes="(max-width: 374px) 100vw, 374px"
              src="/uploads/2018/09/Screen-Shot-2018-12-11-at-3.25.52-pm.png"
              srcset="
                  /uploads/2018/09/Screen-Shot-2018-12-11-at-3.25.52-pm.png         934w,
                  /uploads/2018/09/Screen-Shot-2018-12-11-at-3.25.52-pm-300x86.png  300w,
                  /uploads/2018/09/Screen-Shot-2018-12-11-at-3.25.52-pm-768x220.png 768w
                "
              width="374"
            />
            <figcaption>
              Optimising a website can be an enjoyable process. If you liken it
              to tuning a motor to run very smoothly.
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <hr class="wp-block-separator" />
        <p style="font-size: 12px">
          Technical notes: – static html – css/less – javascript for animations
          – font-awesome icons
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
